    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/636865b8cca0a0a962c21f3f/n1PEv1RXr_QrhK7DIZbOg.png) ⟨28⟩\nAI4Manufacturing⟨28⟩\n/\nAM11_DED316L_texture_hardness_agent_only⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nFollow\n![⟨30⟩] AI4Manufacturing 13\nModalities:  Text ⟨31⟩\nFormats:  parquet ⟨32⟩\nSize:  < 1K ⟨33⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨34⟩ pandas ⟨35⟩ Polars ⟨36⟩ + 1\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨37⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨38⟩ Community ⟨39⟩\n##  You need to agree to share your contact information to access this dataset\nThis repository is publicly accessible, but you have to accept the conditions to access its files and content.\nLog in⟨40⟩ or Sign Up⟨41⟩ to review the conditions and access this dataset content.\n  * Tasks⟨42⟩\n  * Schema⟨43⟩\n  * Source Notes⟨44⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨45⟩ AM11 DED 316L Texture and Hardness \nThis dataset contains 45 tabular QA/SFT records derived from DED 316L thin-wall experiments.\n##   ⟨42⟩ Tasks \n  * 25 records: process parameters and wall height -> average Vickers hardness HV.\n  * 7 records: cooling rate -> texture anisotropy Ahkl and average Vickers hardness HV.\n  * 13 records: cooling rate -> average Vickers hardness HV only, because Ahkl is missing in the source CSV.\n\n\nRows with missing Ahkl do not ask for texture anisotropy and do not contain null targets in `annot`.\n##   ⟨43⟩ Schema \nEach row uses the unified Forge schema:\n  * `query`: task template plus the structured input values.\n  * `annot`: JSON string target.\n  * `reasoning`: null.\n  * `cate`: task category.\n  * `task`: Forge task ID.\n  * `metadata`: JSON string with source, units, task subtype, and target availability.\n  * `image`: null, because this is a tabular dataset.\n\n\n##   ⟨44⟩ Source Notes \nThe source files are `Fig3.csv` and `Fig10.csv` from the local DED 316L texture/hardness dataset. The scan-speed unit is ambiguous in the source and is preserved with a metadata note.\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    21\nTotal file size: 16.6 kB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨46⟩ Privacy⟨47⟩ About⟨48⟩ Careers⟨49⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
